    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Protected by an\narmor-like hide,\nit is capable of\fliving in molten\nlava of 3,600\ndegrees.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "blue",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/2/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Walks on its hind\nlegs. Shows signs\nof intelligence.\fIts armor-like\nhide even repels\nmolten lava.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "yellow",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its rugged hide\nprotects it from\neven the heat of\flava. However, the\nhide also makes it\ninsensitive.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "gold",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its brain devel­\noped when it began\nwalking on hind\flegs. Its thick\nhide protects it\neven in magma.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "silver",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "By lightly spin­\nning its drill-\nlike horn, it can\feasily shatter\neven a diamond in\nthe rough.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "crystal",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "RHYDON’s horn can crush even uncut\ndiamonds. One sweeping blow of its tail\ncan topple a building.\fThis POKéMON’s hide is extremely tough.\nEven direct cannon hits don’t leave\na scratch.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "RHYDON has a horn that serves as a\ndrill. It is used for destroying rocks\nand boulders.\fThis POKéMON occasionally rams into\nstreams of magma, but the armor-like\nhide prevents it from feeling the heat.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its horn, which rotates like a drill,\ndestroys tall buildings with one strike.\nIt stands on its hind legs, and its brain\nis well developed.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "emerald",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It begins walking on its hind legs after\nevolution. It can punch holes through\nboulders with its horn.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "firered",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/10/"
      }
    },
    {
